{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06247","headline":"送大理正摄御史判凉州别驾 · 苑咸","name":"送大理正摄御史判凉州别驾","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天子念西疆，咨君去不遑。\n垂银棘庭印，持斧柏台纲。\n雪下天山白，泉枯塞草黄。\n伫闻河陇外，还继海沂康。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苑咸","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06247.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06247","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}